<title>USA: Vigo Cty School Corp., Ind., won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Vigo Cty School Corp., Ind., won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth, Inc., said it won $1.900 million of Vigo Cty School Corp., Ind., school building bonds of 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.80425 percent.</p>
